cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you publish an image made with Render the Molecule, please cite this tool
  as below, together with Molecular Nodes, Blender, the Protein Data Bank and
  the primary publication of the PDB entry you rendered.
title: Render the Molecule
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bhoir
    given-names: Vishal
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vishalbhoir18/renderthemolecule"
abstract: >-
  A web application that renders publication-quality images of Protein Data
  Bank entries from their PDB ID, using Blender and the Molecular Nodes add-on.
keywords:
  - molecular visualization
  - structural biology
  - Protein Data Bank
  - Blender
  - Molecular Nodes
